<!--
  /components — the single component-library page.

  Two sections, top-to-bottom:
    1. <sui-language-showcase> — the "Language" surface. Five panels that
       evidence the compiler features that shipped in 0.3 (the deletion of
       sui-stack / sui-cluster, and the introduction of the layout keywords,
       sx, <theme>, <variants>, and motion).
    2. <sui-component-catalog> — the curated public primitive gallery,
       grouped by category (Forms & Inputs / Layout / Overlays / …) with a
       search box and a per-cell live preview.

  The page consumes the same `/components/[tag]` detail view for every card;
  the catalog is the gallery index, the showcase is the language narrative.
-->
<sui-language-showcase></sui-language-showcase>
<sui-component-catalog></sui-component-catalog>
